{"last_link_id": 78, "nodes": [{"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "links": [], "label": "output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "size": [345.1251220703125, 484.70001220703125], "pos": [4241.6298828125, 308.55181884765625], "widgets_values": ["作为资深工艺说明书设计师，我已完全接收您的需求。针对您提出的**【多条毛巾组合：玫瑰花（红绿撞色）】**，我将原有的“兔子”逻辑完美平移至“玫瑰花”的制作工序中，并严格遵循强逻辑三分法布局。\n\n由于目前 AI 绘画工具（如 Midjourney）对极其精准的中文汉字生成仍有局限，我为您设计了**“视觉结构与排版提示词”**。此提示词能完美生成带有 IKEA 极简风格、箭头、虚线、分步框以及毛巾质感的图纸。**（建议：生成底图后，使用 Canva 或 PS 填入我为您规划的精准中文文案，效果将达到商业出版级）。**\n\n以下是为您定制的 Midjourney 提示词及全案设计规划：\n\n### 🛠️ Midjourney V6 英文提示词 (直接复制使用)\n\n> **Prompt:**\n> A professional IKEA-style instructional manual for towel folding, vertical layout, pure white background #FFFFFF, separated by ultra-thin gray horizontal lines. Divided into three sections. **TOP SECTION (40%):** A close-up photorealistic image of a beautiful rose flower made of folded fluffy terry cloth towels. The rose petals are bright red, the stem and leaves are vibrant green. Trendy toy gift aesthetic. Infographic leader lines pointing to the texture. Text layout space for \"成品效果\". **MIDDLE SECTION (20%):** Flat lay of materials. One large green rectangular towel (35x75cm), two small red square towels (25x25cm). Minimalist line-art icons of rubber bands and scissors. Text layout space for \"步骤 0：材料准备\". **BOTTOM SECTION (40%):** A grid of 4 square step-by-step instructional panels with bold circled numbers ① ② ③ ④ in the top left corners. Panel 1: rolling the green rectangular towel with solid black directional arrows. Panel 2: folding the red square towel diagonally, with a red star icon at the center. Panel 3: twisting the red towel into rose petals, with dashed fold lines. Panel 4: assembling the red flower onto the green stem, with a large red directional arrow showing insertion. Technical drawing style, clean, professional, infographic design, UI/UX, 8k resolution, highly detailed --ar 9:16 --v 6.0 --style raw\n\n---\n\n### 📐 视觉排版与中文标注执行指南 (后期填字参考)\n\n请在生成的底图上，按照以下坐标和文案进行中文排版（推荐字体：思源黑体 / 阿里巴巴普惠体，字重分明）：\n\n#### 1. 顶部 - 成品样照展示 (Top 40%)\n*   **主标题 (左上角大字/粗体):** `成品效果：毛巾玫瑰花`\n*   **引线标注 1 (指向红色花朵):** `完成形态：层次堆叠花瓣`\n*   **引线标注 2 (指向绿色叶片):** `高克重毛圈毛巾，蓬松定型`\n\n#### 2. 中部 - 材料准备阶段 (Middle 20%)\n*   **板块标题 (居中/中等字号):** `步骤 0：材料准备`\n*   **物品标注 (对应图片位置):**\n    *   指着大绿毛巾：`A. 主体毛巾 (绿色 35x75cm) - 用于枝干与叶片`\n    *   指着小红方巾：`B. 组件方巾 (红色 25x25cm x2) - 用于玫瑰花冠`\n*   **辅助图标旁:** `辅助材料：橡皮筋 x3、剪刀`\n\n#### 3. 底部 - 分步折叠指南 (Bottom 40%)\n*   **板块标题:** `分步折叠教学 (模块化拼接)`\n*   **【Step ①】框内文字:** `第一步：双向对卷` (小字副标题：将绿色大毛巾沿长边向中心【卷】起，形成枝干基础)\n*   **【Step ②】框内文字:** `第二步：中心固定` (小字副标题：将红色方巾对角【折】叠，星号处使用橡皮筋【扎】紧)\n*   **【Step ③】框内文字:** `第三步：折叠花瓣` (小字副标题：沿虚线翻折红色方巾边缘，制造玫瑰花瓣层次)\n*   **【Step ④】框内文字:** `第四步：最终拼接` (小字副标题：将红色花冠【拼】插入绿色枝干顶端，底部扎口加固)\n\n---\n\n### 💡 设计师专业建议：\n1. **色彩控制：** 提示词中已强化 `bright red` 和 `vibrant green`，确保红绿撞色符合年轻女性潮玩市场的明快审美，避免暗沉。\n2. **材质触感：** 强调了 `fluffy terry cloth towels`（蓬松毛圈布），AI 会在顶部特写中着重表现毛巾的颗粒感和柔软度。\n3. **符号逻辑：** 提示词已强制 AI 生成实线箭头（代表动作卷/插）、虚线（代表折痕）、星号（代表扎口固定点），这能极大降低受众的理解门槛，实现零基础教学。"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 40, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {"pinned": true, "collapsed": false}, "id": 41, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "response", "links": [40, 61], "label": "response", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "response"}], "size": [400, 398], "pos": [3694.79296875, 890.7067260742188], "widgets_values": ["gemini-3.1-pro-preview", "", "2,0", 0.6, 1142536225, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image1", "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image4", "label": "image4", "type": "IMAGE", "lo